(7649367, 1243902, 114285, '<td valign="top">I had a feeling this was yours, Stunning image, composition perfect, pleasing subject and great processing. BTW 2nd place isn''t exactly losing :0) Look on the bright side...you gave me a run for my money. I will let you have the ribbon race this year. I have an entry which will most likely tank in the black and white landscape but I like it, after that I have nothing until the extended editing. Looking forward to having a big break and entering only what takes my fancy. All the best with your health and your photography.</td>', 'I had a feeling this was yours, Stunning image, composition perfect, pleasing subject and great processing. BTW 2nd place isn''t exactly losing :0) Look on the bright side...you gave me a run for my money. I will let you have the ribbon race this year. I have an entry which will most likely tank in the black and white landscape but I like it, after that I have nothing until the extended editing. Looking forward to having a big break and entering only what takes my fancy. All the best with your health and your photography.', '2020-01-03 00:15:32.000000', NULL, 0),
